### Create new user
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ring",
    "type": "DOORBELL",
    "location": "Living Room",
    "userId": 3
}

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/device/1

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/device/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Airpods",
    "type": "SPEAKER",
    "location": "Bed Room",
    "userId": 3
}

### Delete user
DELETE  http://localhost:8081/api/v1/device/2